		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Mechanical Familiar</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Build a clockwork familiar that lasts a day.</em></p><p><strong>Cast Time: 1 minute.</strong> You create a familiar per Magical Familiar, though it's mechanical in nature and lasts 24 hours.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> 1 Action, Burst, Damage: STRd6 Fire; the familiar is destroyed.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on Perception (WIL) while the familiar is active.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STRd6 Fire in a burst around the familiar.</em></p><p><em>[M] The book omits the Burst size; Burst 1 is assumed. Delete the familiar token afterwards (it is destroyed).</em></p>",
